{%- comment -%}
  The wordmark.

  Rendered as a CSS mask rather than an inline <svg> or an <img>. A mask keeps
  `currentColor` working — so the mark inherits hover and focus colour like the
  Next.js build does — without pasting 10KB of traced path data into every page.
{%- endcomment -%}
<span
  class="wordmark"
  role="img"
  aria-label="heavyskint. — home"
  style="display:inline-block;background-color:currentColor;-webkit-mask:url({{ 'wordmark.svg' | asset_url }}) no-repeat center/contain;mask:url({{ 'wordmark.svg' | asset_url }}) no-repeat center/contain;aspect-ratio:1317/258;"
></span>
